    "updated_at": "2025-11-20T08:04:12Z",
    "body": "Good point.\n\nI think there are some potentially odd corner cases though:\n\n| shadow \\\\/ document > | null | scoped | global |\n|--------|--------|--------|--------|\n| null | shadowrootcustomelementregistry? | should be impossible | shadowrootcustomelementregistry? |\n| scoped | shadowrootcustomelementregistry? | should be impossible | shadowrootcustomelementregistry? |\n| global | should be impossible | should be impossible | - |\n\nSo maybe the check should really be that if the document's registry is not global or the shadow's registry is not global, then we append.\n\ncc @rniwa @ja-y-son @sorvell ",
