    "body": "> That doesn't account for the shadow root being in a scoped registry?\n\nThat's not a backwards compatible concern though, is it? It seems like in that case we can just decide what's best, and I think going by the shadowRoot's existing registry, when possible, makes the most sense.\n\n",
