    "body": "Yes, that matches my current understanding. 😅 And yeah, we should include that test, plus maybe some additional asserts to make sure `contentDocument` indeed gets the scoped registry as I don't think that's implemented right now. (I'll leave updating my WPT PR for this and proposing a specification change for next week, but if someone wants to have a go at it, by all means, have at it. 😊)",
